{
 "title": "Chapter 2: The Moneybag and the Tsars",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 2: The Moneybag and the Tsars",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s03b01",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Moscow first shows up in the records in *1147*.",
     "shot": "c2_1147",
     "date": 1147,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:records",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b02",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "For a long time it was *nothing* special.",
     "shot": "c2_woodtown",
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b03",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A *wooden* town in the forest.",
     "shot": "c2_woodtown",
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b04",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But its princes were *clever*.",
     "shot": "c2_clever",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:clever",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b05",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "One of them, Ivan I, won the Mongols' *trust* by collecting tribute for them from other Russian lands.",
     "shot": "c2_kalita",
     "date": 1325,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:tribute",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b07",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And he pocketed a *share*.",
     "shot": "c2_kalita",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:share",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b08",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Russians nicknamed him Ivan *Kalita*.",
     "shot": "c2_moneybag",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Kalita",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "gag": false
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b09",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Ivan the *Moneybag*.",
     "shot": "c2_moneybag",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:Moneybag",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "gag": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b10",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He used the money to buy *land*, build influence,",
     "shot": "c2_influence",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:land",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop",
       "w:influence",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b11",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and bring the head of the Orthodox *Church* to Moscow.",
     "shot": "c2_influence",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Church",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b12",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Moscow didn't rise by *defying* the Mongols.",
     "shot": "c2_working",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:defying",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b13",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It rose by *working* for them.",
     "shot": "c2_working",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:working",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b14",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then, in 1480, a later ruler, Ivan III, simply *stopped* paying.",
     "shot": "c2_stoppay",
     "date": 1480,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:stopped",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b15",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The two armies faced each other across the *Ugra* River for weeks.",
     "shot": "c2_ugra",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b16",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*Neither* attacked.",
     "shot": "c2_ugra",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b17",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Eventually, the Mongols *withdrew*.",
     "shot": "c2_ugra",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "gallop",
       "w:withdrew",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b18",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Over two centuries of rule ended *without* a decisive battle.",
     "shot": "c2_ugra",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b19",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Ivan III absorbed rival cities and took the *double-headed* eagle as his symbol.",
     "shot": "c2_eagle",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:eagle",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b20",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "After Constantinople *fell* to the Ottomans in 1453,",
     "shot": "c2_thirdrome",
     "date": 1453,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:fell",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b21",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "he began presenting *Moscow* as the new centre of Orthodox Christianity.",
     "shot": "c2_thirdrome",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Moscow",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "date": 1500
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b22",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Some Russian thinkers called it the *Third* Rome.",
     "shot": "c2_thirdrome",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Rome",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b23",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "His grandson, Ivan IV, was crowned in 1547 as the first *Tsar* of all Russia.",
     "shot": "c2_crowned",
     "date": 1547,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:crowned",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b24",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The title came from *Caesar*.",
     "shot": "c2_crowned",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Caesar",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b25",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "History remembers him as Ivan the *Terrible*.",
     "shot": "c2_terrible",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Terrible",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b26",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A better translation of the Russian word is *fearsome*.",
     "shot": "c2_terrible",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:fearsome",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b27",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And he earned *both*.",
     "shot": "c2_terrible"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b28",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He *crushed* his nobles.",
     "shot": "c2_terror",
     "date": 1565,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b29",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He launched waves of *terror* against his own people.",
     "shot": "c2_terror",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b30",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And by tradition, he killed his own *son* in a rage.",
     "shot": "c2_terror",
     "quiet": true,
     "date": 1581
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b31",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But Ivan also understood something about a country without *walls*.",
     "shot": "c2_distance"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b32",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "If you can't build a barrier, you can build *distance*.",
     "shot": "c2_distance",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:distance",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b33",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So Russia went *east*.",
     "shot": "map:east",
     "date": 1552,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:east",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b34",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 1552, it took *Kazan*.",
     "shot": "map:east",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Kazan",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b35",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 1582, a Cossack leader named Yermak crossed the *Ural* Mountains into Siberia.",
     "shot": "map:east",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Siberia",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "date": 1582
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b36",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A land of forests, rivers, and one very *valuable* animal.",
     "shot": "c2_sable",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b37",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The *sable*.",
     "shot": "c2_sable",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:sable",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b38",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Its fur was so prized that people called it *soft* gold.",
     "shot": "c2_sable",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:gold",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b39",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Traders and soldiers *pushed* on.",
     "shot": "c2_ostrog",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b40",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "They built *forts*, demanded tribute, and moved again.",
     "shot": "c2_ostrog",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:forts",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "coins",
       "w:tribute",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b41",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By 1639, Russians had reached the *Pacific*.",
     "shot": "map:pacific",
     "date": 1639,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Pacific",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b42",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In about 60 years, Russia had crossed a *continent*.",
     "shot": "map:pacific"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b43",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But there was a *catch*.",
     "shot": "c2_catch",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:catch",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b44",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It was gaining *land* far faster than it was gaining people.",
     "shot": "c2_catch"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b45",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And soon, its rulers would decide how to *fix* that.",
     "shot": "c2_catch"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03i01",
     "text": "Keep *one* thing in mind for the rest of this video.",
     "shot": "in_bill",
     "type": "HOST",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "swish",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03i02",
     "text": "Every time Russia had more land than people… somebody paid the *bill*.",
     "shot": "in_bill",
     "type": "HOST",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:bill",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03i03",
     "text": "Bill number one is coming up. *Watch* who pays it.",
     "shot": "in_bill",
     "type": "HOST"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}